1693
01:17:55.540 --> 01:18:06.780
Well, if it were me, I guess I would be propped up, maybe watching TV, eating a bowl of frozen yogurt or making bread.
嗯，如果是我的话，我想我会是被支撑着，可能在看电视，吃着一碗冷冻酸奶或者在做面包。

1694
01:18:07.580 --> 01:18:09.600
And you can come say goodbye to me.
然后你可以来和我告别。

1695
